es effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Thanking and Responding to Thanks", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are in a formal situation, remember to thank people when they do something for you, and remember to use the Simple Present tense.<br><br>You respond to thanks with expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You're welcome </span> or <span class=\"italic\">My pleasure</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thanking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to thanks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thank you so much! <br>You saved my life!<br>I owe you one! (less formal)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My pleasure.<br> You're welcome.<br> No worries. (less formal) </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I owe you one!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Thank you very much! I must return the favor. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thank you for the new bag. I owe you one!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le09ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you